TI  - Threats and Corrective Measures for IoT Security with Observance of Cybercrime: A Survey
T2  - WIRELESS COMMUNICATIONS & MOBILE COMPUTING
KW  - BIG DATA ANALYTICS
KW  - IP-BASED INTERNET
KW  - THINGS IOT
KW  - SMART HEALTH
