TI  - Strategies and systems towards grids and clouds integration: A DBMS-based solution
T2  - FUTURE GENERATION COMPUTER SYSTEMS-THE INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ESCIENCE
KW  - Resource integration
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Grid computing
KW  - Distributed environments
KW  - Heterogeneous environments
KW  - Multi/many core computing
