TI  - An identity attribute-based encryption using elliptic curve digital signature for patient health record maintenance
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF COMMUNICATION SYSTEMS
KW  - cloud computing
KW  - decryption
KW  - Diffie-Hellman (DH)
KW  - elliptic curve cryptography (ECC)
KW  - encryption
