TI  - Blockchain technology as a Fog computing security and privacy solution: An overview
T2  - COMPUTER COMMUNICATIONS
KW  - FC
KW  - BC
KW  - Challenge
KW  - Security
KW  - Privacy
KW  - RESEARCH ISSUES
KW  - ACCESS-CONTROL
