TI  - Efficient Public Key Encryption With Outsourced Equality Test for Cloud-Based IoT Environments
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INFORMATION FORENSICS AND SECURITY
KW  - Encryption
KW  - Internet of Things
KW  - Cloud computing
