T2  - 2020 IEEE INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON COMMUNICATIONS, CONTROL, AND COMPUTING TECHNOLOGIES FOR SMART GRIDS, SMARTGRIDCOMM
CP  - 2020 International Conference on Communications Control and Computing Technologies for Smart Grids
KW  - distributed control
