TI  - SLDS: Secure and location-sensitive data sharing scheme for cloud-assisted Cyber-Physical Systems
T2  - FUTURE GENERATION COMPUTER SYSTEMS-THE INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ESCIENCE
KW  - Data sharing
KW  - Location verification
KW  - Access control
KW  - Cyber-Physical Systems
KW  - Cloud computing
