TI  - A Novel Length-Flexible Lightweight Cancelable Fingerprint Template for Privacy-Preserving Authentication Systems in Resource-Constrained IoT Applications
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
KW  - Fingerprint recognition
KW  - Internet of Things
