TI  - A Game Theoretic Analysis for Cooperative Smart Farming
T2  - 2020 IEEE INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON BIG DATA (BIG DATA)
CP  - 8th IEEE International Conference on Big Data (Big Data)
