TI  - When Collaborative Treebank Curation Meets Graph Grammars
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 12TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON LANGUAGE RESOURCES AND EVALUATION (LREC 2020)
CP  - 12th International Conference on Language Resources and Evaluation (LREC)
KW  - dependency treebanks
