TI  - An IoT Assisted Secured Healthcare Management Scheme based on RFID and Crypto Security Enhancement Model
T2  - 2022 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INVENTIVE COMPUTATION TECHNOLOGIES, ICICT 2022
CP  - 5th International Conference on Inventive Computation Technologies (ICICT)
KW  - Crypto Security Enhancement Model
