TI  - Cloud to cloud data migration using self sovereign identity for 5G and beyond
T2  - CLUSTER COMPUTING-THE JOURNAL OF NETWORKS SOFTWARE TOOLS AND APPLICATIONS
KW  - Transport layer security (TLS)
KW  - Third-party auditor (TPA)
KW  - Self-sovereign identity (SSI)
