TI  - An Efficient SDFRM Security System for Blockchain Based Internet of Things
T2  - INTELLIGENT AUTOMATION AND SOFT COMPUTING
KW  - Internet of things
KW  - blockchain
KW  - data privacy
KW  - security system
KW  - distributed management
KW  - IIoT
