TI  - An Anonymous Pre-Authentication and Post-Authentication Scheme Assisted by Cloud for Medical IoT Environments
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON NETWORK SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING
KW  - Cloud computing
KW  - Authentication
KW  - Servers
KW  - Protocols
KW  - Security
