TI  - Smart Public Transportation Sensing: Enhancing Perception and Data Management for Efficient and Safety Operations
T2  - SENSORS
KW  - intelligent transportation system
KW  - spatial database
KW  - edge computing
KW  - BIG DATA
KW  - ACCESS-CONTROL
KW  - VEHICLES
